      <description># Mailday 0.1.12

- Add account now opens with two large, clearly labelled cards: Gmail and Other email (IMAP).
- Provider logos, short descriptions and guidance for custom domains make the connection options easier to find.
- Choose a card to open its connection form, and go back to switch services.
- Existing Gmail and IMAP/SMTP connection, security and cancellation behaviour is retained.
